                                "nl": "De ridder was in het hele koninkrijk beroemd om zijn moedige <w>heldendaden</w>."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Stories of her heroic <w>deeds</w> were told for generations.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
